  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Remove wire racks from oven. Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut capsicum into bite-sized chunks.\n• Thinly slice red onion (see ingredients).\n• Cut paneer cheese into 2cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b521bcb653703ca93c02/step-57ce4900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a medium bowl, combine paneer, half the Greek-style yoghurt (see ingredients), curry powder and a generous drizzle of olive oil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b521bcb653703ca93c02/step-4b0cec10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Add capsicum and Mumbai spice blend and cook until tender and fragrant, 5-6 minutes.\n• Transfer to a large bowl, then add onion and baby spinach leaves. Drizzle with olive oil and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b521bcb653703ca93c02/step-92d18520.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place large wraps directly on the wire oven racks, rough-side down, then use the back of a spoon to spread over passata. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b521bcb653703ca93c02/step-4a5bcc30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Top wraps with capsicum mix, marinated paneer and grated mozzarella.\n• Bake until cheese is melted and golden, 10-12 minutes.\n• TIP: Placing the pizzas directly on the wire rack helps the base to crisp up.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b521bcb653703ca93c02/step-d8daae40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide fragrant yoghurt paneer and spinach pizzas between plates.\n• Dollop over remaining yoghurt.\n• Tear over coriander (see ingredients).\n• Sprinkle with chilli flakes (if using).\n• Season the pizzas with black pepper and slice to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b521bcb653703ca93c02/step-fffd7b50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
